+# POST /api/sheets/{sheetId}/claims/{claimId}/shares — shares a claim with another person of the sheet: their share
+# (a percent, two decimals, more than 0.00) of its due counts in their due-total, settled-total and open-total, and
+# comes off its own person's. The claim's own person, a person already holding a share, shares adding up to more than
+# 100.00, or a SETTLED, VOID or DELETED claim is a 409 and a claim not on the sheet a 404, neither writing anything.
+# Responds with the claim as stored.
